{"id":"7d3e31f637bf7b00","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-universally-measurable-set.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive4 Universally Measurable Set","display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-universally-measurable-set — ZFC Descriptive4 Universally Measurable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-universally-measurable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive4-universally-measurable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-universally-measurable-set — ZFC Descriptive4 Universally Measurable Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-topology]]","[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-probability-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-universally-measurable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-universally-measurable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive4-universally-measurable-set — ZFC Descriptive4 Universally Measurable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"573e015d328ead90\" href=\"?note=573e015d328ead90\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure\">58-df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MeasureCompletion}\\subseteq V^{5}\">\\(\\operatorname{MeasureCompletion}\\subseteq V^{5}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniversallyMeasurableSet}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniversallyMeasurableSet}_S\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span> (topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathcal B(X,\\tau)\\)</span> (Borel sigma-algebra operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MeasureCompletion}\">\\(\\operatorname{MeasureCompletion}\\)</span> (measure-completion predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"573e015d328ead90\" href=\"?note=573e015d328ead90\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure\">58-df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniversallyMeasurableSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniversallyMeasurableSet}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}universally\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniversallyMeasurableSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mu\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{55pt}\\to\\exists\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{MeasureCompletion}(\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau),\\mu)\n\\land A\\in\\widehat\\Sigma\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}universally\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4UniversallyMeasurableSet}_S(X,\\tau,A)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land A\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\mu\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{55pt}\\to\\exists\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{MeasureCompletion}(\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu,X,\\mathcal B(X,\\tau),\\mu)\n\\land A\\in\\widehat\\Sigma\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Universal measurability is membership in the completion for every Borel probability measure on the given topological space.  The assertion now calls the registered three-place probability-measure predicate and five-place completion predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-borel]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-probability-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure","status":"resolved","id":"573e015d328ead90","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}$ (topology predicate, see [[58-df-topology]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","